    "The print will be cancelled and can't be resumed.": {
      "comment": "Stop print confirmation message",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打印将被取消，且无法恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The printer didn't respond to the command. Developer LAN mode is probably off on the printer; turn it on in its LAN settings to control it from NozzleCast.": {
      "comment": "Error message when a printer command is sent but the printer doesn't respond.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打印机未响应命令。打印机可能已关闭开发者 LAN 模式；请在其 LAN 设置中开启，以便从 NozzleCast 控制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected spool's material \"%@\" doesn't match the tray material \"%@\" for %@. Your server will also set this slot's filament settings on the printer to match the spool, so the printer will treat the slot as \"%@\" even though the filament loaded there is unchanged. Assign anyway?": {
      "comment": "Material mismatch confirmation when assigning a spool whose material differs from what the printer reports for that AMS slot",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The selected spool's material \"%1$@\" doesn't match the tray material \"%2$@\" for %3$@. Your server will also set this slot's filament settings on the printer to match the spool, so the printer will treat the slot as \"%4$@\" even though the filament loaded there is unchanged. Assign anyway?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选耗材材料“%1$@”与 %2$@ 槽位报告的材料“%3$@”不匹配。服务器还会在打印机上设置该槽位的耗材参数以匹配耗材，因此即使槽位中装载的耗材未变，打印机会将该槽位视为“%4$@”。仍要分配吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The SpoolBuddy reads its RFID tag, and the spool opens here.": {
      "comment": "SpoolBuddy scan: waiting for a tag",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SpoolBuddy 读取其 RFID 标签后，将在此打开对应耗材卷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These printers and spools are samples. Connect your server in Settings to see your own.": {
      "comment": "Demo data banner: no server configured",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些打印机和耗材均为示例。在设置中连接服务器即可查看你自己的设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Bambu Lab tag isn't linked to any spool in your inventory yet.": {
