    },
    "Usage": {
      "comment": "Spool screen section: prints that used this spool",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Used for future AMS slot configuration — matching this to the spool's real print temperature matters once that's wired up.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于后续 AMS 槽位配置；待该功能接入后，与耗材实际打印温度的匹配将十分重要。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "View on Bambu Wiki": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在拓竹 Wiki 查看"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warning · paused the print": {
      "comment": "HMS alert level 2",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "警告 · 已暂停打印"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weight & Cost": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重量与成本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without a Firebase config, NozzleCast reads the alerts your server sends to your notification providers (ntfy, Pushover, Discord, email…) from its notification log, and shows new ones as notifications. It checks whenever the app refreshes, and in the background when iOS allows, so alerts can arrive late. For instant alerts, import the GoogleService-Info.plist from the Firebase project your ntfy server publishes through.": {
      "comment": "Settings footer explaining the alert fallback without Firebase",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未配置 Firebase 时，NozzleCast 会从通知日志读取服务器发送给各通知渠道（ntfy、Pushover、Discord、邮件等）的告警，并以通知形式展示。应用刷新时以及 iOS 允许的后台时机进行检查，因此告警可能延迟到达。如需即时告警，请从 ntfy 服务器所发布的 Firebase 项目导入 GoogleService-Info.plist。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without Developer LAN mode the printer won't accept pause, stop, homing or RFID re-reads from NozzleCast. Turn it on in the printer's LAN settings.": {
      "comment": "Explains why printer controls are disabled",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未开启开发者 LAN 模式时，打印机不会接受来自 NozzleCast 的暂停、停止、回 Home 或 RFID 重读指令。请在打印机 LAN 设置中开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your API key can't read your server's notifications. Give it the notifications:read permission.": {
      "comment": "Alert feed error: API key lacks permission",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API 密钥无法读取服务器通知，请授予 notifications:read 权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your self-hosted nozzlecast-relay's URL and RELAY_AUTH_SECRET. This lets a Live Activity start the instant a print begins, even while your phone is locked.": {
      "comment": "A description of the Push-to-Start Relay.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你自建 nozzlecast-relay 的 URL 和 RELAY_AUTH_SECRET。有了它，打印一开始即可启动实时活动，即使手机处于锁定状态。"
          }
        }
      }
