    },
    "NozzleCast stops receiving ntfy pushes and reads your server's alerts from its notification log instead, which can be late.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "NozzleCast stops receiving ntfy pushes and reads your server's alerts from its notification log instead, which can be late."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NozzleCast 停止接收 ntfy 推送，改为从服务器通知日志读取告警，可能有延迟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NozzleCast reads the alerts your server sends to its notification providers from its notification log, whenever the app refreshes and in the background when iOS allows, so they can arrive late. For instant alerts, add a Webhook provider on your server pointing at the relay's /bambuddy/alerts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "NozzleCast reads the alerts your server sends to its notification providers from its notification log, whenever the app refreshes and in the background when iOS allows, so they can arrive late. For instant alerts, add a Webhook provider on your server pointing at the relay's /bambuddy/alerts."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NozzleCast 会在应用刷新时以及 iOS 允许的后台时机，从通知日志读取服务器发送给各通知渠道的告警，因此告警可能延迟到达。如需即时告警，请在服务器上添加指向中继 /bambuddy/alerts 的 Webhook 渠道。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alerts keep coming through your relay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Alerts keep coming through your relay."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "告警仍会通过中继送达。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alerts come from your ntfy server through the Firebase project in the imported config. To have your relay deliver them instead, with muted alerts kept off the Lock Screen, add a Webhook provider on your server pointing at the relay's /bambuddy/alerts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Alerts come from your ntfy server through the Firebase project in the imported config. To have your relay deliver them instead, with muted alerts kept off the Lock Screen, add a Webhook provider on your server pointing at the relay's /bambuddy/alerts."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "告警经由导入配置中的 Firebase 项目，来自你的 ntfy 服务器。若改由中继推送、并让已静音告警不出现在锁屏上，请在服务器上添加指向中继 /bambuddy/alerts 的 Webhook 渠道。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your server sends its alerts to your relay, and NozzleCast fetches them from it, leaving out the ones you've muted. Your relay has no Apple push keys, so nothing can wake NozzleCast when an alert fires: while it's open alerts show within seconds, otherwise when iOS next lets it check in the background, which can be much later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Your server sends its alerts to your relay, and NozzleCast fetches them from it, leaving out the ones you've muted. Your relay has no Apple push keys, so nothing can wake NozzleCast when an alert fires: while it's open alerts show within seconds, otherwise when iOS next lets it check in the background, which can be much later."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器将告警发送到中继，NozzleCast 从中继获取，并排除你已静音的告警。中继没有 Apple 推送密钥，因此告警触发时无法唤醒 NozzleCast：应用打开时几秒内即可看到，否则要等 iOS 下次允许后台检查，可能晚得多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your server sends its alerts to your relay, which pushes them here, leaving out the ones you've muted. NozzleCast doesn't need ntfy or a Firebase config for them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Your server sends its alerts to your relay, which pushes them here, leaving out the ones you've muted. NozzleCast doesn't need ntfy or a Firebase config for them."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器将告警发送到中继，由中继推送到此处，并排除你已静音的告警。NozzleCast 接收这些告警无需 ntfy 或 Firebase 配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These arrive silently and stay out of the Notifications list.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "These arrive silently and stay out of the Notifications list."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些将静默送达，不出现在通知列表中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
